{"id":"2fde03a6d2510f36","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Forcing5 Bounding Forcing","display":"df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing — ZFC Forcing5 Bounding Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing — ZFC Forcing5 Bounding Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[58-df-p-name]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing — ZFC Forcing5 Bounding Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"58-df-p-name\">58-df-p-name</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in M\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in M\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\)</span> are as in the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S\\)</span> is the four-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\dot f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot f,\\mathbb P)\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\in\\check\\omega^{\\check\\omega}\\urcorner\\to\\exists g\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\leq^*\\check g\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\dot f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot f,\\mathbb P)\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\in\\check\\omega^{\\check\\omega}\\urcorner\\to\\exists g\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\leq^*\\check g\\urcorner)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bounding means that every name forced to be a real function is eventually dominated by a ground-model function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-p-name","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-p-name]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing5\\text{-}bounding\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5BoundingForcing}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow \\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\dot f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot f,\\mathbb P)\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\in\\check\\omega^{\\check\\omega}\\urcorner\\to\\exists g\\in M\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(1_{\\mathbb P}\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\ulcorner\\dot f\\leq^*\\check g\\urcorner)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-forcing5-bounding-forcing]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","46b2495f214783c3","51e31cce24feee5c"]}